just power being seized,

00:00:20.779 --> 00:00:24.720
just someone being pushed
out and someone being put in.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.430
Coups happen in so many different ways,

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.770
but I wanna show you how
the coup has been used

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.540
by the United States of America

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.420
as a tool to get what they
want on the world stage.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.530
So let me walk you through

