And number three, we need
concrete evidence that

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.850
the US was actually involved,
not just speculation.

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:13.440
While the US has been involved in

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.900
tons of regime change
efforts around the world,

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.090
