00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.610
The next coup has to do with Spain.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.022
Well, actually more like Spain's colonies.

00:03:56.022 --> 00:03:58.920
(percussive ambient music)

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.990
Spain's glory days have come and gone.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.370
They are a declining empire

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.190
and there is major
resistance in their colonies,

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.800
especially in Cuba, Puerto
Rico, and the Philippines.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.899
Meanwhile, the US is a rising empire

00:04:09.899 --> 00:04:12.210
and they already are
pretty uncomfortable with

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:15.570
Spain having colonies like a
hundred miles off their coast.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:17.280
But at the same time, they
don't love the idea of

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.150
true independence for places
like Cuba or Puerto Rico.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.300
These are strategic islands
right in the US's neighborhood.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.937
And like Hawaii, American
companies have money invested,

00:04:26.937 --> 00:04:28.400
particularly in Cuba.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.110
Independence might mean
them getting kicked out.

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.730
So the US delves into this fight

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.500
between Spain and their colonies.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.110
They use the explosion
of an American Navy ship

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.250
as their excuse,

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.130
even though it was likely
an accident, not an attack.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.710
But sometimes stories
matter more than truth.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:46.570
So the US sends in troops
to liberate the rebels

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.750
fighting against their Spanish colonizers,

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.430
promising them independence,

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.290
not only in Cuba and Puerto Rico,

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:55.110
but later, over here in
the Philippines and Guam.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:58.620
These local uprisings eventually
drive out the Spanish,

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.500
and in all of these cases, the
US reneges on their promise

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.240
to give independence to these locals.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.580
And they figure out ways to
govern Cuba and Puerto Rico

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.260
indirectly themselves.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.210
The US has just piggybacked off

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.800
several independence movements

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:13.200
to enact several coups at once,

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.420
