pro-American leaders

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:17.040
and a Navy base in Cuba,

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.410
and eventually annexing
Puerto Rico and Guam,

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.850
which they still control,

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:23.730
and the Philippines, which
they held for 48 years.

